Description: Staging package skeleton for the D2 source-list retirement.
    M3 (2026-10-24): R CMD check must pass on this nearly-empty package
    before any application code moves in. M4 (2026-10-25): the WHOLE
    R/plotting domain lives here (plot_dims, palettes, theme, export,
    datatable, complex_heatmap — exact set pinned by
    tests/testthat/test-plotting-pkg-pilot.R). M5 lot 1 (2026-10-25):
    the 4 report-provider files of R/core join the tree (state,
    error_log, io_helpers, provenance — physical move only, tests keep
    source_project_file() at the new path, no loader change this lot;
    cf. docs/audits/d2_reports_cartography.md section 1). Measured
    decision: the skeleton STAYS under tools/ — a root DESCRIPTION would
    make R CMD check treat all remaining files of R/ as package code and
    change project-type detection in renv/testthat/shinytest2 (M3
    measurement, cf. tests/testthat/test-pkg-skeleton.R header). Tests
    load the package with pkgload::load_all() via load_project_pkg();
    app.R still source()s the extracted files from here (zero app
    behavior change) until the root-move question is explicitly decided
    by the operator.
